"    <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 24px 8px 24px; font-size:15px; line-height:22px;\">\n"
"        <p style=\"margin:0; padding:12px 14px; border-left:4px solid #b42318; background-color:#f9fafb;\">What to do: check why the payment was not made (debit rejected, payment not generated or not posted) and pay the installment, or contact the insurer about the coverage.</p>\n"
